{"id":401004601,"chapter_id":50025,"scene_id":52522,"steps":[{"step":2,"speaker":"“代理”","content":"目标禁闭者在往山庄东北方向移动，那里有她的同伙。山庄内的所有治安官，尽全力拦截她。","voice":["vo_event_401004601_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10046","style":11,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"治安官","content":"可……可我们的工作只是保护洋房的安全，保护那个女人。","voice":["vo_event_401004601_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10046","style":1,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"治安官","content":"MBCC追踪队还在吧？我知道他们没走远，他们就在山庄外等着，为什么不让他们来！","voice":["vo_event_401004601_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10046","style":1,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"“代理”","content":"他们有别的任务。","voice":["vo_event_401004601_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10046","style":11,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"“代理”","content":"你们要做的，就是捕获山庄内这个虚弱的禁闭者。不要让她逃走，也不要让她死了。","voice":["vo_event_401004601_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10046","style":11,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"治安官","content":"虚弱……你管这个叫虚弱？","voice":["vo_event_401004601_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10046","style":1,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"他说不出话了，花道的另一头，那个暴走的怪物正向自己冲来，巨大的恐惧如同咆哮的烈风，瞬间撕碎了治安官的理智。","style":3,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"加洛法诺？","content":"让开——！","voice":["vo_event_401004601_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10046","style":1,"background":2102,"log_type":1}]}